    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong editorial hierarchy, cohesive cyan/red security palette, crisp panel construction, and consistent typography make desktop and tablet feel polished. However, desktop leaves an awkwardly empty upper-right field, while mobile becomes an excessively tall, cramped stack with dense monospace copy, narrow red panels, and awkward line wrapping. The global header is also visually tiny and clipped into a horizontal “MORE” rail on tablet/mobile, weakening orientation and finish.",
